cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Selective KV Cache Recomputation for Long-Context Transformer Inference (LLM + VLM)"
abstract: >-
  This repository accompanies a research paper on selective key/value cache
  recomputation for Transformer inference on long contexts. It contains two
  side-by-side codebases: a text-only LLM pipeline implementing selective KV
  cache recomputation and Ring-Attention sequence parallelism for Qwen3,
  Llama, and ChatGLM (under `llm/`), and a vision-language counterpart for
  Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct with image chunking (under `vlm/`). Reproduces the
  paper's `sp_guided_recompute`, `sp_cacheblend`, `sp_lego`, and
  `ring_attention` baselines on LongBench v1/v2, and the BLINK / VLMEvalKit
  results.
authors:
